{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45035","headline":"奉和陆中丞使君长源寒食日作 · 皎然","name":"奉和陆中丞使君长源寒食日作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒食江天气最清，庾公晨望动高情。\n因逢内火千家静，便覩行春万木荣。\n深浅山容飞雨细，萦纡水态拂云轻。\n腰章本郡谁相似，数日临人政已成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}